"""Generator for the ORIGINAL v1 test set (57 queries, v1 labels) -> queries_v1.jsonl.

The current test set, queries.jsonl (67 queries, 23 cheap / 22 mid / 22 frontier), is NOT
generated by this script. It is v1 plus my relabels (q07, q48, ...) and 10 new queries,
edited by hand. Edit queries.jsonl directly; this script never writes to it.

Usage: python make_queries.py [output]   (default queries_v1.jsonl; refuses to overwrite
an existing file unless you pass --force, and always refuses queries.jsonl).
"""
